{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":4,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":57,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1895221,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":282964,"Name":"samwillow","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1430666099,"LastPoster":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1895221,"PostDate":1430666099,"PostContent":"well, in this time. i dont know how to start my wedding planning. i discussed with my boyfriend a...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"samwillow39@gmail.com","IpAddress":"114.121.164.128","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430664822,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"samwillow","Id":282964,"Name":"samwillow","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"114.121.164.128","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79144,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4c6dace72e1a2782722c4e68b6cdb050","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;well, in this time. i dont know how to start my wedding planning. i discussed with my boyfriend about this, and he said that we must choose the concept. but i think it&#039;s not the first thing, i thinked we must know our budget and choose the number of guests, because we really2 need to prepare the all budget by ourself. thats no help from our parents. what do you think? can give us some idea?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895221,"PostDate":1430666099,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>well, in this time. i dont know how to start my wedding planning. i discussed with my boyfriend about this, and he said that we must choose the concept. but i think it's not the first thing, i thinked we must know our budget and choose the number of guests, because we really2 need to prepare the all budget by ourself. thats no help from our parents. what do you think? can give us some idea?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"samwillow39@gmail.com","IpAddress":"114.121.164.128","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430664822,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"samwillow","Id":282964,"Name":"samwillow","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.161.170.48","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79144,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6e1793dc9d303a7b3bb8c61edcefacb1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the forum, samwillow, and Congrats on your upcoming wedding!!! you&#039;ve come to the right place to get lots of great information, ideas, suggestions and support from everyone here - so well done on getting a good start already!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;here are a few magical wedding \"moments that matter\" for added inspiration..taken from &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153270894224487.1073741928.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;The RUI Palace Peninsula Cancun Wedding Album&lt;\/a&gt;...enjoy!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xta1\/t31.0-8\/1980358_10153270895379487_2144611720278088419_o.jpg\" alt=\"1980358_10153270895379487_21446117202780\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/11182657_10153270896109487_5614574020468908688_o.jpg\" alt=\"11182657_10153270896109487_5614574020468\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/11136216_10153270897364487_782806863449110843_o.jpg\" alt=\"11136216_10153270897364487_7828068634491\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895226,"PostDate":1430673353,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to the forum, samwillow, and Congrats on your upcoming wedding!!! you've come to the right place to get lots of great information, ideas, suggestions and support from everyone here - so well done on getting a good start already!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>here are a few magical wedding \"moments that matter\" for added inspiration..taken from <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153270894224487.1073741928.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>The RUI Palace Peninsula Cancun Wedding Album<\/a>...enjoy!<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xta1\/t31.0-8\/1980358_10153270895379487_2144611720278088419_o.jpg\" alt=\"1980358_10153270895379487_21446117202780\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/11182657_10153270896109487_5614574020468908688_o.jpg\" alt=\"11182657_10153270896109487_5614574020468\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/11136216_10153270897364487_782806863449110843_o.jpg\" alt=\"11136216_10153270897364487_7828068634491\"><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280210660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.119.165.154","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79144,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5d93653160b7b9e84531c6049c84e013","RawContent":"[quote name=\"samwillow\" post=\"1895221\" timestamp=\"1430666099\"]\nwell, in this time. i dont know how to start my wedding planning. i discussed with my boyfriend about this, and he said that we must choose the concept. but i think it&#039;s not the first thing, i thinked we must know our budget and choose the number of guests, because we really2 need to prepare the all budget by ourself. thats no help from our parents. what do you think? can give us some idea?[\/quote]Congratulations on your engagement!  I would recommend contacting a destination wedding travel agent.  They will give you lots of ideas and will provide you with a great deal of information.  :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1895230,"PostDate":1430676206,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>samwillow, on Today, 07:14 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>well, in this time. i dont know how to start my wedding planning. i discussed with my boyfriend about this, and he said that we must choose the concept. but i think it's not the first thing, i thinked we must know our budget and choose the number of guests, because we really2 need to prepare the all budget by ourself. thats no help from our parents. what do you think? can give us some idea?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Congratulations on your engagement!\u00a0 I would recommend contacting a destination wedding travel agent.\u00a0 They will give you lots of ideas and will provide you with a great deal of information.\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"candice.french@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.62.169.169","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1415121095,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280992.jpg?_r=1421507914","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MissFrench","Id":280992,"Name":"MissFrench","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79144,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by TinkerSofi, Today, 12:15 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1430684145,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f494a0604c26bc9f58355331572bca78","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I definitely think that setting the budget is the first thing and trying to work on a rough draft of your guestlist. This will give you an idea of what kind of wedding you will have and a general feel of what you&#039;re looking at and what kind of destination and resort you need to find. For example, if you have a small budget and a big guestlist you&#039;ll have to either cut the guestlist or you&#039;ll know that you&#039;re going to have to find a hotel with really reasonable prices for a wedding. Also, if you have a lot of guests you need to find a hotel that will be able to accommodate a wedding with that many people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;In a way the budget affects the concept of your wedding because it will dictate how much you can spend on all the little extras. You can definitely have a rough idea of what you want and that&#039;s ok (it might help you narrow down some resorts), but keep in mind that you might change your mind a few times before settling on one concept :), especially once your find your venue. Ours sure did!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy planning!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895233,"PostDate":1430683893,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I definitely think that setting the budget is the first thing and trying to work on a rough draft of your guestlist. This will give you an idea of what kind of wedding you will have and a general feel of what you're looking at and what kind of destination and resort you need to find. For example, if you have a small budget and a big guestlist you'll have to either cut the guestlist or you'll know that you're going to have to find a hotel with really reasonable prices for a wedding. Also, if you have a lot of guests you need to find a hotel that will be able to accommodate a wedding with that many people.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>In a way the budget affects the concept of your wedding because it will dictate how much you can spend on all the little extras. You can definitely have a rough idea of what you want and that's ok (it might help you narrow down some resorts), but keep in mind that you might change your mind a few times before settling on one concept <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>, especially once your find your venue. Ours sure did!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy planning!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359763104,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79144","Title":"First Thing In Planning The Wedding","LastPostDate":1430683893},"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
