{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":14,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":779,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1882992,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":281728,"Name":"natalia555","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281728.png?_r=1421337420","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":240,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1421338462,"LastPoster":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1882992,"PostDate":1421338462,"PostContent":"Hi, \u00a0 My name is Natalia, I am a 25 year old from Edmonton, AB looking to plan a destination wedd...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nataliap555@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"96.52.164.172","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421282184,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281728.png?_r=1421337420","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":240,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"natalia555","Id":281728,"Name":"natalia555","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.52.164.172","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78607,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8d1f091a68c92ac1b0d729daf07fc997","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My name is Natalia, I am a 25 year old from Edmonton, AB looking to plan a destination wedding!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I met with a travel agent a few days ago and am feeling overwhelmed with all the options and prices!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;She suggested Grand Bahia Principe Coba in Riviera Maya for Dec 2015 for best pricing and value for the location and packages.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I found tons of info on it here already and looking forward to spending time here and absorbing all the info! Will definitely be looking at other places as well from here. Any suggestions would definitely be appreciated!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Natalia&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1882992,"PostDate":1421338462,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My name is Natalia, I am a 25 year old from Edmonton, AB looking to plan a destination wedding!<\/p>\n<p>I met with a travel agent a few days ago and am feeling overwhelmed with all the options and prices!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>She suggested Grand Bahia Principe Coba in Riviera Maya for Dec 2015 for best pricing and value for the location and packages.<\/p>\n<p>I found tons of info on it here already and looking forward to spending time here and absorbing all the info! Will definitely be looking at other places as well from here. Any suggestions would definitely be appreciated!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Natalia<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nataliap555@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"96.52.164.172","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421282184,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281728.png?_r=1421337420","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":240,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"natalia555","Id":281728,"Name":"natalia555","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.143.225.246","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78607,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b5a93d6abe67adfeacba61d560c378e7","RawContent":"Welcome! The only thing I would caution for December- is on whether your guests will be able to afford to join you with its proximity to the holidays... If that&#039;s not a concern... Then great! Does your TA specialize in working with brides in DW? Make sure they do... Does she get special perks with GBP? Often TAs will get you little extras. \n\n\nRead that board and get a feel from brides if they were happy with the process and their weddings and then have fun planning!!! \n\n\nCongrats!","Attachments":[],"Id":1882999,"PostDate":1421342840,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Welcome! The only thing I would caution for December- is on whether your guests will be able to afford to join you with its proximity to the holidays... If that's not a concern... Then great! Does your TA specialize in working with brides in DW? Make sure they do... Does she get special perks with GBP? Often TAs will get you little extras. <br><br>\nRead that board and get a feel from brides if they were happy with the process and their weddings and then have fun planning!!! <br><br>\nCongrats! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390256608,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.159.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78607,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4a436efd4abf7e25f43b09fe159fe1ae","RawContent":"Hi @[member=\"natalia555\"], congratulations on your engagement! Meeting with a travel agent is a great first step but I do agree with @[member=\"kmk2016\"] that an agent who specializes in destination weddings is a great asset to have. Make a list of what is important to you (e.g. Price, adults only, beach, etc) and this could help you limit your choices. There are so many wonderful resorts so I know it can get overwhelming! All the brides (and some grooms) on here are really helpful so don&#039;t be afraid to ask questions","Attachments":[],"Id":1883003,"PostDate":1421345855,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281728\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281728-natalia555\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">natalia555<\/span><\/a>, congratulations on your engagement! Meeting with a travel agent is a great first step but I do agree with @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276231\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/276231-kmk2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">kmk2016<\/span><\/a> that an agent who specializes in destination weddings is a great asset to have. Make a list of what is important to you (e.g. Price, adults only, beach, etc) and this could help you limit your choices. There are so many wonderful resorts so I know it can get overwhelming! All the brides (and some grooms) on here are really helpful so don't be afraid to ask questions \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1410098585,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1420071985","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"209.91.107.170","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78607,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7930bf0849ba19b22e61452d0828aabb","RawContent":"Welcome! I agree with the other ladies find a TA that specializes in weddings. I didn&#039;t have much luck in Edmonton so I hope you have better luck :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1883062,"PostDate":1421375511,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Welcome! I agree with the other ladies find a TA that specializes in weddings. I didn't have much luck in Edmonton so I hope you have better luck <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kcrosby86@msn.com","IpAddress":"142.179.243.111","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1398829631,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Kayla88","Id":277780,"Name":"Kayla88","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.101.83.185","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78607,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c03e066321eecbd34c2b8f7b06b65ed0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats and welcome! You&#039;ve already had the best possible advice and that&#039;s to get a great DW travel agent. They will become your best buddy as you go through your planning adventure! There are a number of resorts here so it wouldn&#039;t be right to recommend one just because it might not fit with what you want, and what you want for your wedding as well as for your guests. That&#039;s where the travel agent comes in.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;There is an agent that several ladies here have been working with that is based out west and they seem to really like her. Her name is Laurielee Rosser and here is her contact info:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;TierOne Travel&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/b&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p  class=\"\"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;#303-37 Richard Way SE&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;&lt;\/b&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p  class=\"\"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;Calgary, AB T3E 7M8&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;&lt;\/b&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p  class=\"\"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;Ph: 403-509-9337&amp;nbsp; Toll Free:&amp;nbsp; 1-866-509-9337&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;&lt;\/b&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p  class=\"\"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14pt;\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.laurielee.ca\/&#039;&gt;www.laurielee.ca&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;&lt;\/b&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p  class=\"\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p  class=\"\"&gt;Good luck and happy planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1883071,"PostDate":1421383031,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats and welcome! You've already had the best possible advice and that's to get a great DW travel agent. They will become your best buddy as you go through your planning adventure! There are a number of resorts here so it wouldn't be right to recommend one just because it might not fit with what you want, and what you want for your wedding as well as for your guests. That's where the travel agent comes in.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>There is an agent that several ladies here have been working with that is based out west and they seem to really like her. Her name is Laurielee Rosser and here is her contact info:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><b><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">TierOne Travel<\/span><\/b><\/p>\n<p  class=\"\"><b><i><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">#303-37 Richard Way SE<\/span><\/i><\/b><\/p>\n<p  class=\"\"><b><i><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">Calgary, AB T3E 7M8<\/span><\/i><\/b><\/p>\n<p  class=\"\"><b><i><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">Ph: 403-509-9337\u00a0 Toll Free:\u00a0 1-866-509-9337<\/span><\/i><\/b><\/p>\n<p  class=\"\"><b><i><span  style=\"font-size:14pt\"><a href='http:\/\/www.laurielee.ca\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>www.laurielee.ca<\/a><\/span><\/i><\/b><\/p>\n<p  class=\"\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  class=\"\">Good luck and happy planning!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283458999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78607,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"53c70b8e1f3afb56852908812b0f7e7c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome and congrats from another Canadian bride!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I agree that starting with a good travel agent will be so valuable. &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;The one I used was phenomenal, if you have any troubles finding one and want her info just let me know.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I totally recommend you do a lot of your own research to ensure her suggestion for you is what you want. &amp;nbsp;My travel agent recommended quite a few throughout Mexico for us and we did end up with one of hers, but we also priced a lot of our own. &amp;nbsp; You also want to look into their wedding packages, etc. to ensure they are a fit for your wedding as well - it&#039;s double sided now, not only do you need a good resort but also a good wedding department &amp;amp; packages. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I leave in 2 sleeps for my wedding - heheh I love saying that now.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1883073,"PostDate":1421385252,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome and congrats from another Canadian bride!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I agree that starting with a good travel agent will be so valuable. \u00a0 \u00a0The one I used was phenomenal, if you have any troubles finding one and want her info just let me know.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I totally recommend you do a lot of your own research to ensure her suggestion for you is what you want. \u00a0My travel agent recommended quite a few throughout Mexico for us and we did end up with one of hers, but we also priced a lot of our own. \u00a0 You also want to look into their wedding packages, etc. to ensure they are a fit for your wedding as well - it's double sided now, not only do you need a good resort but also a good wedding department & packages. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck!<\/p>\n<p>I leave in 2 sleeps for my wedding - heheh I love saying that now.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399428602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.100.196.75","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78607,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9cfde69504637e5ad6dc36bbd3ca456f","RawContent":"Woot! Congrats fellow Canadian! \n\nI have stayed at the Grand Principe Coba and for your guests it would be a fantastic experience! :) \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1883080,"PostDate":1421413102,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Woot! Congrats fellow Canadian! <br>\nI have stayed at the Grand Principe Coba and for your guests it would be a fantastic experience! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"himojo86@aol.com","IpAddress":"207.164.255.140","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1420896457,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Majix26","Id":281666,"Name":"Majix26","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"190.167.90.221","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78607,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3ce63e42973762cc7be147a1ef802652","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome Natalia and Congrats on your recent engagement and upcoming dw!!! as you see, there&#039;s lots of excellent support, suggestions and info in these boards that will be helpful with your planning decisions, so well done on a great start already :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;One suggestion to consider when choosing your resort &amp;nbsp;- is whether the resort you choose allows outside vendors. If photography is important to you, we highly recommend you have a professional capture your Big Day b\/c they will create a magical photo record of your Wedding Day Love Story that you&#039;ll cherish for a lifetime!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here&#039;s a comparison of a resort photographer&#039;s picture and what a professional captures - for a dramatic demonstration of what a difference it makes.....with more at this link: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152644932899487.1073741911.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Professional Photographers vs Resort Photographer&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-b-atl.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/v\/t1.0-9\/10610675_10152644933054487_2680815615112427167_n.jpg?oh=fa2aff193cfa382d287a770d5a905529&amp;amp;oe=552A78FE\" alt=\"10610675_10152644933054487_2680815615112\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-h-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/10644738_10152644933309487_46653044229079535_o.jpg\" alt=\"10644738_10152644933309487_4665304422907\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;After all the energy you spend carefully planning and preparing your celebration in intricate detail, once the party is over, the dancing is done and your guests have gone home, what&#039;s left are your memories and the photos of those once-in-a-lifetme \"moments that matter\"!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1883087,"PostDate":1421424099,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome Natalia and Congrats on your recent engagement and upcoming dw!!! as you see, there's lots of excellent support, suggestions and info in these boards that will be helpful with your planning decisions, so well done on a great start already <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>One suggestion to consider when choosing your resort \u00a0- is whether the resort you choose allows outside vendors. If photography is important to you, we highly recommend you have a professional capture your Big Day b\/c they will create a magical photo record of your Wedding Day Love Story that you'll cherish for a lifetime!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here's a comparison of a resort photographer's picture and what a professional captures - for a dramatic demonstration of what a difference it makes.....with more at this link: <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152644932899487.1073741911.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Professional Photographers vs Resort Photographer\u00a0<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-b-atl.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/v\/t1.0-9\/10610675_10152644933054487_2680815615112427167_n.jpg?oh=fa2aff193cfa382d287a770d5a905529&oe=552A78FE\" alt=\"10610675_10152644933054487_2680815615112\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-h-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/10644738_10152644933309487_46653044229079535_o.jpg\" alt=\"10644738_10152644933309487_4665304422907\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>After all the energy you spend carefully planning and preparing your celebration in intricate detail, once the party is over, the dancing is done and your guests have gone home, what's left are your memories and the photos of those once-in-a-lifetme \"moments that matter\"!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280210660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"172.5.209.133","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78607,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7bbf8c95a769248c5900d94a256c73a2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Natalia!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am from Toronto, got engaged in August and still havent booked anything yet. My fiance and I spent a month down in Mexico in November searching for the perfect venue. We have narrowed ours down to the Dreams Tulum and the Azul Sensatori. We are planning a January 2016 wedding, so not far off from yours! Good luck!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1883155,"PostDate":1421507700,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Natalia!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am from Toronto, got engaged in August and still havent booked anything yet. My fiance and I spent a month down in Mexico in November searching for the perfect venue. We have narrowed ours down to the Dreams Tulum and the Azul Sensatori. We are planning a January 2016 wedding, so not far off from yours! Good luck!!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tmariemurphy@icloud.com","IpAddress":"172.5.209.133","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421507351,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281756.jpg?_r=1425743587","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"TaraMarie33","Id":281756,"Name":"TaraMarie33","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.100.61.37","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78607,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eebf2ae8276a02ef98aa8b119c26afad","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the forum and congrats!!!&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This forum is a gold mine for resources and tips, so you are in the right place. Definitely use the search function as it will help you a ton as you begin the journey of planning your dream wedding&amp;nbsp; :D&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1883924,"PostDate":1422093171,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to the forum and congrats!!!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This forum is a gold mine for resources and tips, so you are in the right place. Definitely use the search function as it will help you a ton as you begin the journey of planning your dream wedding\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<span style='font-size: 18px;'><span style='font-family: georgia'><strong class='bbc'>MARIESAM SANCHEZ PHOTOGRAPHY<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br \/>\nWEBSITE: <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchez.com'>www.mariesamsanchez.com<\/a><br \/>\nBLOG: <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchezblog.com'>www.mariesamsanchezblog.com<\/a><br \/>\nCONTACT: <a href='mailto:mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com?subject=BDW%20Inquiry' title='E-mail Link' class='bbc_email'>mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com<\/a><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<img src='http:\/\/i287.photobucket.com\/albums\/ll150\/msam007562\/063cb5c8-dbda-4822-87fe-ba3c0ebcdb7f.jpg' alt='Posted Image' class='bbc_img' \/>","Email":"mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.100.61.37","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1285954345,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232833.jpg?_r=1422091823","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":220,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MarieSamSanchezPhoto","Id":232833,"Name":"MarieSamSanchezPhoto","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78607","Title":"Newly Engaged Canadian Planning Destination Wedding!","LastPostDate":1423584138},"Pages":{"TotalItems":14,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
