nEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2a25584c0600f4f888b1ace3c8f956c5","RawContent":"Hi everyone!\n \n I&#039;m booking my wedding at the Ocean Turquesa and was hoping people could offer feedback and\/or that we could post anything and everything OT related.\n \n Thanks!\n \n Jennie :)","Attachments":[],"Id":527732,"PostDate":1228526903,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi everyone!<br \/> <br \/> I'm booking my wedding at the Ocean Turquesa and was hoping people could offer feedback and\/or that we could post anything and everything OT related.<br \/> <br \/> Thanks!<br \/> <br \/> Jennie <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Jennie & Dave<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10716;116\/st\/20100209\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/f02c\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...f02c\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jcrsby@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1227307174,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212805.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":130,"PhotoHeight":97,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JCrosby","Id":212805,"Name":"JCrosby","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a7c682685c69c3e98ee8e0e1055e9dc8","RawContent":"Hi,\n I am going to have my wedding at Ocean Coral and Turquesa on Feb. 7 2009. I have not been able to find anyone else who got married here- so thats a little nerve wracking. But the pictures look beautiful and the price is right! Have you been able to find any one to give you any more info or good sites regarding the Ocean Coral and Turquesa? \n Thanks\n Kaycee","Attachments":[],"Id":531468,"PostDate":1228966313,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi,<br \/> I am going to have my wedding at Ocean Coral and Turquesa on Feb. 7 2009. I have not been able to find anyone else who got married here- so thats a little nerve wracking. But the pictures look beautiful and the price is right! Have you been able to find any one to give you any more info or good sites regarding the Ocean Coral and Turquesa? <br \/> Thanks<br \/> Kaycee\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Kaycee<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"klink53@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1223695623,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212217.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"klink","Id":212217,"Name":"klink","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3ffeb381779f2e5de05eefa903684580","RawContent":"Hi Kaycee,\n \n That&#039;s so exciting!! Congratulations! How has the wedding coordinator been to work with? Are you getting married on the beach? Where are you having your reception? You probably have way more information than I do but I do have some pics from the wedding coordinator of different reception options if you want me to email them to you. \n \n I think that there could be fewer brides for this resort because they just renovated and rebranded themselves with a new name and stuff. I&#039;m hoping that&#039;s why. I do have a friend that stayed there last March and she said it&#039;s a very beautiful spot and she had a great time.\n \n Please feel free to share anything and everything about your plans, I&#039;d love to hear all about everything. \n \n Jennie","Attachments":[],"Id":533923,"PostDate":1229297931,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Kaycee,<br \/> <br \/> That's so exciting!! Congratulations! How has the wedding coordinator been to work with? Are you getting married on the beach? Where are you having your reception? You probably have way more information than I do but I do have some pics from the wedding coordinator of different reception options if you want me to email them to you. <br \/> <br \/> I think that there could be fewer brides for this resort because they just renovated and rebranded themselves with a new name and stuff. I'm hoping that's why. I do have a friend that stayed there last March and she said it's a very beautiful spot and she had a great time.<br \/> <br \/> Please feel free to share anything and everything about your plans, I'd love to hear all about everything. <br \/> <br \/> Jennie\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Jennie & Dave<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10716;116\/st\/20100209\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/f02c\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...f02c\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jcrsby@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1227307174,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212805.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":130,"PhotoHeight":97,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JCrosby","Id":212805,"Name":"JCrosby","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"efe2dcc88667a0a798e068eadc5d5499","RawContent":"Hey Jennie,\n I am just starting to work with the wc now. My TA has been working with her until now. Her name is Ana I will keep you posted on how communication goes with her. Yes, I want the ceremony to be on the beach, but I am not sure where I will have the reception yet- I would love to see the pictures that you have- my e-mail is \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:klink53@hotmail.com\"&gt;klink53@hotmail.com&lt;\/a&gt; There is going to be about 25 of us so that should be perfect! It&#039;s really cold in Montana now so we can&#039;t wait to be in the sun and sand in Mexico! I have the wedding packages and pricing if you do not have that let me know. \n Look forward to hearing from you.\n Kaycee","Attachments":[],"Id":534283,"PostDate":1229339082,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey Jennie,<br \/> I am just starting to work with the wc now. My TA has been working with her until now. Her name is Ana I will keep you posted on how communication goes with her. Yes, I want the ceremony to be on the beach, but I am not sure where I will have the reception yet- I would love to see the pictures that you have- my e-mail is <br \/> <a href='mailto:klink53@hotmail.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>klink53@hotmail.com<\/a> There is going to be about 25 of us so that should be perfect! It's really cold in Montana now so we can't wait to be in the sun and sand in Mexico! I have the wedding packages and pricing if you do not have that let me know. <br \/> Look forward to hearing from you.<br \/> Kaycee\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Kaycee<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"klink53@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1223695623,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212217.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"klink","Id":212217,"Name":"klink","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7896d4d7528d94bee81ff0b68843de6d","RawContent":"You must be so excited!!! I just emailed you the pictures and a bit of other info that I had. Happy planning! \n \n J :)","Attachments":[],"Id":534683,"PostDate":1229392590,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                You must be so excited!!! I just emailed you the pictures and a bit of other info that I had. Happy planning! <br \/> <br \/> J <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Jennie & Dave<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10716;116\/st\/20100209\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/f02c\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...f02c\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jcrsby@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1227307174,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212805.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":130,"PhotoHeight":97,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JCrosby","Id":212805,"Name":"JCrosby","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3ebc18b4bfa174556d5e506187f9af8e","RawContent":"Thanks Jennie! Got the e-mail. I think I like the reception by the pool- but I will probably wait till we are there and decide after I see it in person- as we will be there 5 days before the wedding. Thanks for all your info- its much appriciated!\n Kaycee","Attachments":[],"Id":535385,"PostDate":1229465565,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks Jennie! Got the e-mail. I think I like the reception by the pool- but I will probably wait till we are there and decide after I see it in person- as we will be there 5 days before the wedding. Thanks for all your info- its much appriciated!<br \/> Kaycee\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Kaycee<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"klink53@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":12