{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"875526e6e81ae8bc55da53581aff2555","RawContent":"Hello everyone.\n \n I&#039;m new here :) I am also interested in getting married at Ocean Turquesa, could somebody also send me the wedding packages that they offer?? :) I&#039;ve emailed the resort but I&#039;m not too sure that I had the right contacts.\n \n How&#039;s all the planning going so far?? \n \n Thanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":553331,"PostDate":1231412132,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello everyone.<br \/> <br \/> I'm new here <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I am also interested in getting married at Ocean Turquesa, could somebody also send me the wedding packages that they offer?? <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I've emailed the resort but I'm not too sure that I had the right contacts.<br \/> <br \/> How's all the planning going so far?? <br \/> <br \/> Thanks!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;6\/st\/20100701\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/6f5c\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...6f5c\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bvit@telus.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1231386279,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213700.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":102,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Barbo","Id":213700,"Name":"Barbo","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c95765e580ecaea645b1dce60b07c074","RawContent":"Barb - I have the packages and I&#039;ll send them to you tonight. Maybe send me your email and I&#039;ll send you all the info I have.\n \n MsShelly - I haven&#039;t been but I&#039;ve been researching the resort for a couple of months and have decided to get married there. We may do a site visit this winter if we can find a good deal but if not, I&#039;m still confident in getting married there.\n \n Hope this helps!\n Jennie","Attachments":[],"Id":553394,"PostDate":1231435438,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Barb - I have the packages and I'll send them to you tonight. Maybe send me your email and I'll send you all the info I have.<br \/> <br \/> MsShelly - I haven't been but I've been researching the resort for a couple of months and have decided to get married there. We may do a site visit this winter if we can find a good deal but if not, I'm still confident in getting married there.<br \/> <br \/> Hope this helps!<br \/> Jennie\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Jennie & Dave<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10716;116\/st\/20100209\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/f02c\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...f02c\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jcrsby@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1227307174,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212805.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":130,"PhotoHeight":97,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JCrosby","Id":212805,"Name":"JCrosby","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ba21c34c02219707afd6951e46c3fdee","RawContent":"Oh wow thanks! \n \n My email is &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:bvit@telus.net\"&gt;bvit@telus.net&lt;\/a&gt; \n \n I really love this resorts layout and that it&#039;s small enough that you won&#039;t have to go far to run into your family and friends :) I heard about other weddings at larger resorts where they had to call each others rooms or cellphones to coordinate meeting up with each other... \n \n Talk to you soon :)","Attachments":[],"Id":554718,"PostDate":1231500495,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Oh wow thanks! <br \/> <br \/> My email is <a href='mailto:bvit@telus.net' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>bvit@telus.net<\/a> <br \/> <br \/> I really love this resorts layout and that it's small enough that you won't have to go far to run into your family and friends <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I heard about other weddings at larger resorts where they had to call each others rooms or cellphones to coordinate meeting up with each other... <br \/> <br \/> Talk to you soon <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;6\/st\/20100701\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/6f5c\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...6f5c\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bvit@telus.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1231386279,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213700.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":102,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Barbo","Id":213700,"Name":"Barbo","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e18259d8da370d6cdff6697900653f1a","RawContent":"Ok, I&#039;m sending you some reception option pictures, the answers to some questions I had and the different packages. That&#039;s about all I have right now. \n \n I know, I love the layout so much - 90% of rooms have some type of ocean view!! Also, it&#039;s only about 20 mins from the airport and it&#039;s only 30mins to Cancun and Playa del Carmen. \n \n When are you looking at getting married? We&#039;re hoping for Feb 2010!","Attachments":[],"Id":554778,"PostDate":1231521949,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Ok, I'm sending you some reception option pictures, the answers to some questions I had and the different packages. That's about all I have right now. <br \/> <br \/> I know, I love the layout so much - 90% of rooms have some type of ocean view!! Also, it's only about 20 mins from the airport and it's only 30mins to Cancun and Playa del Carmen. <br \/> <br \/> When are you looking at getting married? We're hoping for Feb 2010!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Jennie & Dave<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10716;116\/st\/20100209\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/f02c\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...f02c\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jcrsby@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1227307174,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212805.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":130,"PhotoHeight":97,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JCrosby","Id":212805,"Name":"JCrosby","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6dfdff2ddbaeabdf95300f2f04987f50","RawContent":"Hey Ladies!\n Nice to see more ladies joining this thread- yea! Everything seems to be going good- thanks for asking Jennie. A little stessed here and there now that I am at the one month deadline. I promise to let you all know how a wedding is at OCT when I get back mid Feb. Soo busy right now with all the wedding stuff- plus I am running a marathon in AZ in a week. But let me know if you ave any questions I might be able to answer.","Attachments":[],"Id":555211,"PostDate":1231542639,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey Ladies!<br \/> Nice to see more ladies joining this thread- yea! Everything seems to be going good- thanks for asking Jennie. A little stessed here and there now that I am at the one month deadline. I promise to let you all know how a wedding is at OCT when I get back mid Feb. Soo busy right now with all the wedding stuff- plus I am running a marathon in AZ in a week. But let me know if you ave any questions I might be able to answer.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Kaycee<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"klink53@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1223695623,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212217.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"klink","Id":212217,"Name":"klink","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1a8948f9ec06627f6cebc9f62153177f","RawContent":"I&#039;m so excited for you Kaycee!! I&#039;m sure it will all work out great - try not to get too stressed. It&#039;ll be amazing no matter what. :)\n I can&#039;t wait to hear all about it when you get home - I&#039;ll save my questions until then. hehe... \n All the best with the wedding and your marathon,\n Jennie","Attachments":[],"Id":555323,"PostDate":1231545879,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm so excited for you Kaycee!! I'm sure it will all work out great - try not to get too stressed. It'll be amazing no matter what. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br \/> I can't wait to hear all about it when you get home - I'll save my questions until then. hehe... <br \/> All the best with the wedding and your marathon,<br \/> Jennie\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Jennie & Dave<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10716;116\/st\/20100209\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/f02c\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...f02c\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jcrsby@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1227307174,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212805.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":130,"PhotoHeight":97,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JCrosby","Id":212805,"Name":"JCrosby","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f7780aaa09b614761e53708d7fbc8688","RawContent":"Hi girls, just stumbled onto this site and sooo thankful..I have just booked my wedding at the Coral and Turquesa for March 17th. Jennie, if you could send me those pics you have of receptions..that would be sooo great. &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:sbrown039@hotmail.com\"&gt;sbrown039@hotmail.com&lt;\/a&gt; Still in the beginning stages of everything but Ana at the resort seems really nice...hard to understand at times but nice..lol I will keep you all posted as things progress also and I will be looking forward to future posts from you all. Thanks, Shelley","Attachments":[],"Id":556416,"PostDate":1231641542,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi girls, just stumbled onto this site and sooo thankful..I have just booked my wedding at the Coral and Turquesa for March 17th. Jennie, if you could send me those pics you have of receptions..that would be sooo great. <a href='mailto:sbrown039@hotmail.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>sbrown039@hotmail.com<\/a> Still in the beginning stages of everything but Ana at the resort seems really nice...hard to understand at times but nice..lol I will keep you all posted as things progress also and I will be looking forward to future posts from you all. Thanks, Shelley\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sbrown039@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1231621971,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213804.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"silentderra","Id":213804,"Name":"silentderra","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5cc4808c47c67e74fe48f2999c3fb407","RawContent":"Hi Shelley - I emailed you the pictures. Enjoy!!","Attachments":[],"Id":557661,"PostDate":1231737318,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Shelley - I emailed you the pictures. Enjoy!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Jennie & Dave<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10716;116\/st\/20100209\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/f02c\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...f02c\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jcrsby@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1227307174,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212805.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":130,"PhotoHeight":97,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JCrosby","Id":212805,"Name":"JCrosby","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"01ee7db553655875c505bb505158748b","RawContent":"If anyone could post pics or other information that would be great! I am considering this resort for my May 2010 wedding. We are planning a trip to visit all of our &amp;quot;choices&amp;quot; in the early summer. Just trying to gather as much info as possible! Thanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":557671,"PostDate":1231737874,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                If anyone could post pics or other information that would be great! I am considering this resort for my May 2010 wedding. We are planning a trip to visit all of our \"choices\" in the early summer. Just trying to gather as much info as possible! Thanks!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>September 18, 2010- The Royal Playa del Carmen31 Guests RSVP'd including the Bride and Groom<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jkiger85@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1231067921,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213560.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jamk32179","Id":213560,"Name":"jamk32179","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5940bd8a94017a26c464b98d7d2b559f","RawContent":"I got them..thanks Jenny, I think I am going to choose the 2nd pic, the covered area near the resort and have 1 long table for my dinner...I have approx 20-25 ppl booked so far. Do you know if that area is by the pool? \n Hi Jamk, I found a tonne of pics on a site called &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bookit.com\"&gt;Vacation Deals and Travel Specials by BookIt.com\u00ae&lt;\/a&gt; when you pull up this resort they have alot of info and detail about it..also go to trip advisor (I&#039;m sure you have) but I saw alot of pics there too. \n BTW..I found a really nice english speaking minister to perform My ceremony at &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.minister-petra-maurus.com\"&gt;www.minister-petra-maurus.com&lt;\/a&gt; she seems really nice and cheaper than the resort is charging me..she charges 350 inc transportation, the resort 450. Not sure if they&#039;ll allow her on the premises without a fee But I will find out..\n Alright..that&#039;s enough blabbering for now...Sooo excited....Shelley","Attachments":[],"Id":558003,"PostDate":1231785908,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I got them..thanks Jenny, I think I am going to choose the 2nd pic, the covered area near the resort and have 1 long table for my dinner...I have approx 20-25 ppl booked so far. Do you know if that area is by the pool? <br \/> Hi Jamk, I found a tonne of pics on a site called <a href='http:\/\/www.bookit.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Vacation Deals and Travel Specials by BookIt.com\u00ae<\/a> when you pull up this resort they have alot of info and detail about it..also go to trip advisor (I'm sure you have) but I saw alot of pics there too. <br \/> BTW..I found a really nice english speaking minister to perform My ceremony at <a href='http:\/\/www.minister-petra-maurus.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>www.minister-petra-maurus.com<\/a> she seems really nice and cheaper than the resort is charging me..she charges 350 inc transportation, the resort 450. Not sure if they'll allow her on the premises without a fee But I will find out..<br \/> Alright..that's enough blabbering for now...Sooo excited....Shelley\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sbrown039@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1231621971,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213804.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"silentderra","Id":213804,"Name":"silentderra","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2397,"TotalPages":240,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":2390},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
