{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f6f5136186fa10b6eabe2f2cba20210e","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;JCrosby&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Hi Kaycee,\n \n That&#039;s so exciting!! Congratulations! How has the wedding coordinator been to work with? Are you getting married on the beach? Where are you having your reception? You probably have way more information than I do but I do have some pics from the wedding coordinator of different reception options if you want me to email them to you. Jennie&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Hi Jennie,\n \n I&#039;m planning my wedding for Nov 2009 and it&#039;s getting a little nerve wrecking now b&#039;cos it&#039;s less than a year away and I haven&#039;t chosen a resort.\n \n Today, my TA recommended Ocean Turquesa and I would love to see photos of the resort. Could you please send me photos and wedding package info to &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:jon.joann@gmail.com\"&gt;jon.joann@gmail.com&lt;\/a&gt;.\n \n Thanks!!","Attachments":[],"Id":561333,"PostDate":1231996777,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>JCrosby<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hi Kaycee,<br \/> <br \/> That's so exciting!! Congratulations! How has the wedding coordinator been to work with? Are you getting married on the beach? Where are you having your reception? You probably have way more information than I do but I do have some pics from the wedding coordinator of different reception options if you want me to email them to you. Jennie<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Hi Jennie,<br \/> <br \/> I'm planning my wedding for Nov 2009 and it's getting a little nerve wrecking now b'cos it's less than a year away and I haven't chosen a resort.<br \/> <br \/> Today, my TA recommended Ocean Turquesa and I would love to see photos of the resort. Could you please send me photos and wedding package info to <a href='mailto:jon.joann@gmail.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>jon.joann@gmail.com<\/a>.<br \/> <br \/> Thanks!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;53;6\/st\/20091109\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/73b1\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...73b1\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jon.joann@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1227596284,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212862.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jojo","Id":212862,"Name":"Jojo","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b21a2cbb686fee669272d94f041a6f93","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Jojo&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Hi Jennie,\n \n I&#039;m planning my wedding for Nov 2009 and it&#039;s getting a little nerve wrecking now b&#039;cos it&#039;s less than a year away and I haven&#039;t chosen a resort.\n \n Today, my TA recommended Ocean Turquesa and I would love to see photos of the resort. Could you please send me photos and wedding package info to &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:jon.joann@gmail.com\"&gt;jon.joann@gmail.com&lt;\/a&gt;.\n \n Thanks!!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I just emailed them to you. :)","Attachments":[],"Id":561720,"PostDate":1232041000,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Jojo<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hi Jennie,<br \/> <br \/> I'm planning my wedding for Nov 2009 and it's getting a little nerve wrecking now b'cos it's less than a year away and I haven't chosen a resort.<br \/> <br \/> Today, my TA recommended Ocean Turquesa and I would love to see photos of the resort. Could you please send me photos and wedding package info to <a href='mailto:jon.joann@gmail.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>jon.joann@gmail.com<\/a>.<br \/> <br \/> Thanks!!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I just emailed them to you. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Jennie & Dave<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10716;116\/st\/20100209\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/f02c\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...f02c\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jcrsby@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1227307174,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212805.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":130,"PhotoHeight":97,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JCrosby","Id":212805,"Name":"JCrosby","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"53cfd198ab29b02369462b8d34746660","RawContent":"Hi girls, just a question about reception advice...I am having the dinner at the Turquesa in a private area (a la carte restaurant) but nooo idea what to do about the reception after..do we just have it in the lobby..outside by the pool..wherever the action is..?? That doesn&#039;t bother me..it&#039;s just how do we pull off the first dance and things like that? Thanks, Shelley","Attachments":[],"Id":563116,"PostDate":1232139468,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi girls, just a question about reception advice...I am having the dinner at the Turquesa in a private area (a la carte restaurant) but nooo idea what to do about the reception after..do we just have it in the lobby..outside by the pool..wherever the action is..?? That doesn't bother me..it's just how do we pull off the first dance and things like that? Thanks, Shelley\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sbrown039@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1231621971,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213804.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"silentderra","Id":213804,"Name":"silentderra","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d7a871dee2a5c30920262e8142bbb367","RawContent":"We brought our ipod\/speakers with us, so we just set it up right there at the restaurant. Turns out they sent a trio over gratis, so during dinner and afterwards, we had the trio playing for us. Though we were very &amp;quot;go with the flo&amp;quot; as there were only 10 of us altogether","Attachments":[],"Id":563444,"PostDate":1232156134,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We brought our ipod\/speakers with us, so we just set it up right there at the restaurant. Turns out they sent a trio over gratis, so during dinner and afterwards, we had the trio playing for us. Though we were very \"go with the flo\" as there were only 10 of us altogether\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"debbie.copeland@ymail.com","IpAddress":"66.163.16.56","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1171922340,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207190.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Debs","Id":207190,"Name":"Debs","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e11cd6792548e8d195549af02d28a540","RawContent":"Thanks Debs, the i-pod is a great idea...just have to get one now!! LOL","Attachments":[],"Id":563465,"PostDate":1232157092,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks Debs, the i-pod is a great idea...just have to get one now!! LOL\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sbrown039@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1231621971,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213804.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"silentderra","Id":213804,"Name":"silentderra","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"edf78ab0de5d02fe698d85b6cad424c7","RawContent":"Hi everyone, I am interested in having my wedding at this resort too, hopefully in Dec. 09!\n Would anyone be able to send me the pics and wedding info as well? I don&#039;t think their website has much about weddings, so any addtl. info would be great. My email is &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:natr@shaw.ca\"&gt;natr@shaw.ca&lt;\/a&gt;\n Has anyone heard much about the beach\/ocean? I realize the resort is in Puerto Morelos, (more seaweed compared to Playa beach...) \n Oh and will any of you ladies be going to their spa for your hair and makeup? Does this resort have its own photographer? Sorry so many questions!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":563706,"PostDate":1232173101,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi everyone, I am interested in having my wedding at this resort too, hopefully in Dec. 09!<br \/> Would anyone be able to send me the pics and wedding info as well? I don't think their website has much about weddings, so any addtl. info would be great. My email is <a href='mailto:natr@shaw.ca' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>natr@shaw.ca<\/a><br \/> Has anyone heard much about the beach\/ocean? I realize the resort is in Puerto Morelos, (more seaweed compared to Playa beach...) <br \/> Oh and will any of you ladies be going to their spa for your hair and makeup? Does this resort have its own photographer? Sorry so many questions!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"natr@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1227947802,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212920.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bcbride","Id":212920,"Name":"bcbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4c6d67ca6d090367eaf3186ab148ab0d","RawContent":"Hey Bc, I have forwarded some info for you...Jennie has sent me some reception pics also that I will forward to you..good luck with the decision making. Shelley","Attachments":[],"Id":563867,"PostDate":1232219875,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey Bc, I have forwarded some info for you...Jennie has sent me some reception pics also that I will forward to you..good luck with the decision making. Shelley\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sbrown039@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1231621971,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213804.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"silentderra","Id":213804,"Name":"silentderra","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1015e9a0cab8b321098596a0b926800e","RawContent":"I find it interesting that all the brides here looking at this resort are Canadian, except for Shelly who&#039;s going there for her HM. When we were at OB in Punta Cana, there was a really large Canadian contingent, compared to Americans. I wonder if these resorts are marketed more to Canadians than Americans?\n \n What operators are you booking through?","Attachments":[],"Id":563929,"PostDate":1232224449,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I find it interesting that all the brides here looking at this resort are Canadian, except for Shelly who's going there for her HM. When we were at OB in Punta Cana, there was a really large Canadian contingent, compared to Americans. I wonder if these resorts are marketed more to Canadians than Americans?<br \/> <br \/> What operators are you booking through?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"debbie.copeland@ymail.com","IpAddress":"66.163.16.56","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1171922340,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207190.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Debs","Id":207190,"Name":"Debs","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e9d12f17f42e45452586c914dffb06ce","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;bcbride&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Hi everyone, I am interested in having my wedding at this resort too, hopefully in Dec. 09!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I&#039;ve attached the wedding package.\n \n JO&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;5658&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Ocean Turquesa Wedding Packages.doc&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:26.5,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;doc&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":564104,"PostDate":1232245092,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>bcbride<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hi everyone, I am interested in having my wedding at this resort too, hopefully in Dec. 09!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I've attached the wedding package.<br \/> <br \/> JO<p>\u00a0<\/p><span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"5658\",\"name\":\"Ocean Turquesa Wedding Packages.doc\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":26.5,\"type\":\"doc\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;53;6\/st\/20091109\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/73b1\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...73b1\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jon.joann@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1227596284,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212862.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jojo","Id":212862,"Name":"Jojo","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d7b8a0e98fcafb93f96ef33e5007602e","RawContent":"Thanks everyone for all the info!\n Re: operator, I think my TA will book through transat holidays.\n Does anyone know if the resort offers a &amp;quot;free&amp;quot; wedding as well? I found this site\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.oceanhotels.net\/en\/wp.php\"&gt;OCEAN HOTELS - by H10 :: Set on one of the most beautiful white sand beaches in all of B\u00a1varo-Punta Cana. Surrounded by thousands of palm trees....&lt;\/a&gt;\n but at the bottom of the page, it talks about the Dominican govt. I wonder if this package is applicable to Mexico resorts?","Attachments":[],"Id":564115,"PostDate":1232246282,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks everyone for all the info!<br \/> Re: operator, I think my TA will book through transat holidays.<br \/> Does anyone know if the resort offers a \"free\" wedding as well? I found this site<br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.oceanhotels.net\/en\/wp.php' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>OCEAN HOTELS - by H10 :: Set on one of the most beautiful white sand beaches in all of B\u00a1varo-Punta Cana. Surrounded by thousands of palm trees....<\/a><br \/> but at the bottom of the page, it talks about the Dominican govt. I wonder if this package is applicable to Mexico resorts?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"natr@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1227947802,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212920.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bcbride","Id":212920,"Name":"bcbride","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2397,"TotalPages":240,"CurrentPage":30,"NextPage":40,"PreviousPage":20,"LastPage":2390},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
