Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d2a4bfaaed7195326ca1f4abbab6f19f","RawContent":"Hey Bc, I sent you the free wedding package from the wedding planner there. The free wedding isn&#039;t so free though!! lol My fiancee loved it when I told him that we had to pay for our minister and flowers and supper..Buffet is free but no thanks!! They charge 450 for a minister or judge is a little more including transportation. I have decided to get the free package and make my own kinda thing..The free package covers the basics, a la carte restaurant is $20 pp, flowers are 150 maybe for bride and maids, my minister is 350 then 70 for day pass to resort. soo for 20 people..I am spending 970 approx for what I want. The package was 2000 that would of covered what I wanted plus a bunch of things I didn&#039;t need. Do all your homework before choosing..with all the help on this site...it makes it easy!","Attachments":[],"Id":564459,"PostDate":1232309475,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey Bc, I sent you the free wedding package from the wedding planner there. The free wedding isn't so free though!! lol My fiancee loved it when I told him that we had to pay for our minister and flowers and supper..Buffet is free but no thanks!! They charge 450 for a minister or judge is a little more including transportation. I have decided to get the free package and make my own kinda thing..The free package covers the basics, a la carte restaurant is $20 pp, flowers are 150 maybe for bride and maids, my minister is 350 then 70 for day pass to resort. soo for 20 people..I am spending 970 approx for what I want. The package was 2000 that would of covered what I wanted plus a bunch of things I didn't need. Do all your homework before choosing..with all the help on this site...it makes it easy!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sbrown039@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1231621971,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213804.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"silentderra","Id":213804,"Name":"silentderra","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8fa1df424f3ad6e6f02aef8a22cd3a52","RawContent":"You are right Debs...mostly Canadian here!! We booked our package with an agent in Colorado Springs(where my fiancee lives) tour operator is travel impressions..?? but my group booked Transat as well from here.","Attachments":[],"Id":564460,"PostDate":1232309736,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                You are right Debs...mostly Canadian here!! We booked our package with an agent in Colorado Springs(where my fiancee lives) tour operator is travel impressions..?? but my group booked Transat as well from here.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sbrown039@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1231621971,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213804.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"silentderra","Id":213804,"Name":"silentderra","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c1dc44e60caac427ffdc2639f9309e77","RawContent":"Hey Everyone,\n \n We are getting married in November 8-15 at the Coral\/Turquesa and wanted some help with who to contact for the packages, see what dates are available and to get feedback from previous brides\/grooms!\n \n Thanks so much,\n Jordan","Attachments":[],"Id":564657,"PostDate":1232327814,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey Everyone,<br \/> <br \/> We are getting married in November 8-15 at the Coral\/Turquesa and wanted some help with who to contact for the packages, see what dates are available and to get feedback from previous brides\/grooms!<br \/> <br \/> Thanks so much,<br \/> Jordan\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@beyondsound.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1232250881,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-214048.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jordanandkeri","Id":214048,"Name":"jordanandkeri","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d82f5cb4b969b1fb63b3790a380dcdf8","RawContent":"Hello everyone -\n \n I am planning an April 2010 wedding and Ocean Turquesa &amp;amp; Coral is one of my top choices right now (although it changes several times a day). My travel agent LOVES this property (she is also a family friend, so I trust her completely). I have read mixed reviews online about the service at the resort. Does anyone have more information on this? I did receive an email from the wedding coordinator with a lot of info on logistics and their wedding packages attached. If anyone would like me to forward them this, just let me know. I would also LOVE if someone could send me photos of a wedding there, as I have not been able to find any at all. My email is &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:msbaxter@live.com\"&gt;msbaxter@live.com&lt;\/a&gt;. \n \n Thanks!\n \n Becky","Attachments":[],"Id":564824,"PostDate":1232340275,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello everyone -<br \/> <br \/> I am planning an April 2010 wedding and Ocean Turquesa & Coral is one of my top choices right now (although it changes several times a day). My travel agent LOVES this property (she is also a family friend, so I trust her completely). I have read mixed reviews online about the service at the resort. Does anyone have more information on this? I did receive an email from the wedding coordinator with a lot of info on logistics and their wedding packages attached. If anyone would like me to forward them this, just let me know. I would also LOVE if someone could send me photos of a wedding there, as I have not been able to find any at all. My email is <a href='mailto:msbaxter@live.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>msbaxter@live.com<\/a>. <br \/> <br \/> Thanks!<br \/> <br \/> Becky\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"msbaxter@live.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1231290983,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213648.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mctilleys","Id":213648,"Name":"mctilleys","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c361244ae2a1cf4cc66d23527e369b7b","RawContent":"Hi Jordan, The wedding planner there is Ana, her e-mail is &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:weddings.mex@oceanhotels.net\"&gt;weddings.mex@oceanhotels.net&lt;\/a&gt; her number, if you feel like calling mexico, is \n 52-998-287-2100 ext 3021 Dial 011 first to call international.I am getting married there in 2 months and Kaycee who is also on this thread is getting married there next month so we&#039;ll give everyone feedback...","Attachments":[],"Id":565100,"PostDate":1232390926,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Jordan, The wedding planner there is Ana, her e-mail is <a href='mailto:weddings.mex@oceanhotels.net' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>weddings.mex@oceanhotels.net<\/a> her number, if you feel like calling mexico, is <br \/> 52-998-287-2100 ext 3021 Dial 011 first to call international.I am getting married there in 2 months and Kaycee who is also on this thread is getting married there next month so we'll give everyone feedback...\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sbrown039@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1231621971,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213804.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"silentderra","Id":213804,"Name":"silentderra","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3fa1c6a4a05963302e3104b1507babb0","RawContent":"wow, look at all the interest now!!","Attachments":[],"Id":565555,"PostDate":1232414101,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                wow, look at all the interest now!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"debbie.copeland@ymail.com","IpAddress":"66.163.16.56","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1171922340,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207190.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Debs","Id":207190,"Name":"Debs","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"44505fba0963cc2504c0aa5096ec8283","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;silentderra&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Hey Bc, I sent you the free wedding package from the wedding planner there. The free wedding isn&#039;t so free though!! lol My fiancee loved it when I told him that we had to pay for our minister and flowers and supper..Buffet is free but no thanks!! They charge 450 for a minister or judge is a little more including transportation. I have decided to get the free package and make my own kinda thing..The free package covers the basics, a la carte restaurant is $20 pp, flowers are 150 maybe for bride and maids, my minister is 350 then 70 for day pass to resort. soo for 20 people..I am spending 970 approx for what I want. The package was 2000 that would of covered what I wanted plus a bunch of things I didn&#039;t need. Do all your homework before choosing..with all the help on this site...it makes it easy!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Thanks for the info! I agree with you that their &amp;quot;free&amp;quot; wedding package doesn&#039;t come with much. We are also having about 20 people and would rather have a private reception. My fiance is not very happy about the fact that we have to pay for &amp;quot;reception dinner&amp;quot; and &amp;quot;open bar&amp;quot; at an AI. I would consider a reservation at an ala carte restaurant, but I don&#039;t think they would provide a dance floor, sound system, in one of their restaurants? Did you get the rates for addtl items, e.g. flowers, and such from the WC? I will try and email her these questions and hopefully get a timely response :) Thanks for your advice, $970 is alot cheaper than $2000!\n \n PS does anyone know if Ocean Coral\/Turquesa offers timeshare properties?","Attachments":[],"Id":565558,"PostDate":1232414235,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>silentderra<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hey Bc, I sent you the free wedding package from the wedding planner there. The free wedding isn't so free though!! lol My fiancee loved it when I told him that we had to pay for our minister and flowers and supper..Buffet is free but no thanks!! They charge 450 for a minister or judge is a little more including transportation. I have decided to get the free package and make my own kinda thing..The free package covers the basics, a la carte restaurant is $20 pp, flowers are 150 maybe for bride and maids, my minister is 350 then 70 for day pass to resort. soo for 20 people..I am spending 970 approx for what I want. The package was 2000 that would of covered what I wanted plus a bunch of things I didn't need. Do all your homework before choosing..with all the help on this site...it makes it easy!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Thanks for the info! I agree with you that their \"free\" wedding package doesn't come with much. We are also having about 20 people and would rather have a private reception. My fiance is not very happy about the fact that we have to pay for \"reception dinner\" and \"open bar\" at an AI. I would consider a reservation at an ala carte restaurant, but I don't think they would provide a dance floor, sound system, in one of their restaurants? Did you get the rates for addtl items, e.g. flowers, and such from the WC? I will try and email her these questions and hopefully get a timely response <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Thanks for your advice, $970 is alot cheaper than $2000!<br \/> <br \/> PS does anyone know if Ocean Coral\/Turquesa offers timeshare properties?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"natr@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1227947802,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212920.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bcbride","Id":212920,"Name":"bcbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"76a05d88a1c742052b43d521612bf8aa","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;bcbride&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;PS does anyone know if Ocean Coral\/Turquesa offers timeshare properties?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; \n They do for sure. It&#039;s called club H10\n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.clubh10.com\/login.aspx?id=in\"&gt;Club H10. Members&#039; area.&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":565605,"PostDate":1232415922,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>bcbride<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">PS does anyone know if Ocean Coral\/Turquesa offers timeshare properties?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div> <br \/> They do for sure. It's called club H10<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.clubh10.com\/login.aspx?id=in' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Club H10. Members' area.<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"debbie.copeland@ymail.com","IpAddress":"66.163.16.56","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1171922340,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207190.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Debs","Id":207190,"Name":"Debs","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"841c8082b214f3ecccdf262088777bbb","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;bcbride&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Thanks for the info! I agree with you that their &amp;quot;free&amp;quot; wedding package doesn&#039;t come with much. We are also having about 20 people and would rather have a private reception. My fiance is not very happy about the fact that we have to pay for &amp;quot;reception dinner&amp;quot; and &amp;quot;open bar&amp;quot; at an AI. I would consider a reservation at an ala carte restaurant, but I don&#039;t think they would provide a dance floor, sound system, in one of their restaurants? Did you get the rates for addtl items, e.g. flowers, and such from the WC? I will try and email her these questions and hopefully get a timely response :) Thanks for your advice, $970 is alot cheaper than $2000!\n \n PS does anyone know if Ocean Coral\/Turquesa offers timeshare properties?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;\n \n This attachment is what the WC sent me. It lists the wedding packages and marriage requirements. The last page lists the &amp;quot;extras&amp;quot; and their costs. \n \n Hope it helps!\n \n Becky&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;5661&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;WEDDING PACKAGE 2009 OCT.pdf&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:207.2119140625,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;pdf&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":565819,"PostDate":1232427799,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>bcbride<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Thanks for the info! I agree with you that their \"free\" wedding package doesn't come with much. We are also having about 20 people and would rather have a private reception. My fiance is not very happy about the fact that we have to pay for \"reception dinner\" and \"open bar\" at an AI. I would consider a reservation at an ala carte restaurant, but I don't think they would provide a dance floor, sound system, in one of their restaurants? Did you get the rates for addtl items, e.g. flowers, and such from the WC? I will try and email her these questions and hopefully get a timely response <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Thanks for your advice, $970 is alot cheaper than $2000!<br \/> <br \/> PS does anyone know if Ocean Coral\/Turquesa offers timeshare properties?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><br \/> <br \/> This attachment is what the WC sent me. It lists the wedding packages and marriage requirements. The last page lists the \"extras\" and their costs. <br \/> <br \/> Hope it helps!<br \/> <br \/> Becky<p>\u00a0<\/p><span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"5661\",\"name\":\"WEDDING PACKAGE 2009 OCT.pdf\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":207.2119140625,\"type\":\"pdf\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"msbaxter@live.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1231290983,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213648.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mctilleys","Id":213648,"Name":"mctilleys","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"21ca05224cdf80209a12cf3e25b3b057","RawContent":"I will do the A La Carte restaurant supper which is considered semi-private..for 20 pp. (If you go private, your looking at fifty something pp..) You get the restaurant for 1.5 hrs then we will gather wherever the action is and play an i-pod to have our first dance and hopefully there is a band or dj playing in one of the areas..?? not really sure. The WC said that the outside bar by the pool has entertainment\/music until 3am each night but the reviews say there is no entertainment in the evening at that resort??...not sure what to think.\/? Anybody have any info about this?","Attachments":[],"Id":566334,"PostDate":1232489477,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I will do the A La Carte restaurant supper which is considered semi-private..for 20 pp. (If you go private, your looking at fifty something pp..) You get the restaurant for 1.5 hrs then we will gather wherever the action is and play an i-pod to have our first dance and hopefully there is a band or dj playing in one of the areas..?? not really sure. The WC said that the outside bar by the pool has entertainment\/music until 3am each night but the reviews say there is no entertainment in the evening at that resort??...not sure what to think.\/? Anybody have any info about this?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sbrown039@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1231621971,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213804.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"silentderra","Id":213804,"Name":"silentderra","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2397,"TotalPages":240,"CurrentPage":40,"NextPage":50,"PreviousPage":30,"LastPage":2390},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
