{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":2553,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":7,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":188432,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1482069,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":241083,"Name":"RFinger","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241083.jpg?_r=1388290366","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":255,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1309985375,"LastPoster":{"Id":281108,"Name":"TCM4252015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281108.jpg?_r=1415848746","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":224,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":2,"Preview":{"Id":1893854,"PostDate":1429645962,"PostContent":"\u00a0 @DinaQtobe - Are you saying that you were able to get into the club before it was open? I'm ju...","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1417449445,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"159.18.168.14","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c4b5161de914de80a83fbd6e6b946079","RawContent":"[quote name=\"DinaQtobe\" post=\"1890268\" timestamp=\"1426947976\"]\nWe went to the club at the resort and had a GREAT time.  We went before 10 (reception ended at 8:30 I think) and played music through the portable speakers we brought for our reception.  The club and lobby bar are pretty close to each other - drinks came from there before the club \"opened\".  After it opened we had even more fun.  It was super nice to have people congratulating us the entire night.  Great night, great memories![\/quote]\n@[member=\"DinaQtobe\"] - Are you saying that you were able to get into the club before it was open? I&#039;m just looking at my budget and thinking about cutting back on the extra hours we add to our reception for dancing. Maybe we will move to the club instead - I&#039;m thinking at 10, which I think is when it opens. Is it decent in there? I&#039;ve only been in one AI club in Mexico and it was kinda nasty  :unsure:","Attachments":[],"Id":1893854,"PostDate":1429645962,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>DinaQtobe, on 21 March 2015 - 06:26 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>We went to the club at the resort and had a GREAT time.\u00a0 We went before 10 (reception ended at 8:30 I think) and played music through the portable speakers we brought for our reception.\u00a0 The club and lobby bar are pretty close to each other - drinks came from there before the club \"opened\".\u00a0 After it opened we had even more fun.\u00a0 It was super nice to have people congratulating us the entire night.\u00a0 Great night, great memories!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"257303\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/257303-dinaqtobe\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">DinaQtobe<\/span><\/a> - Are you saying that you were able to get into the club before it was open? I'm just looking at my budget and thinking about cutting back on the extra hours we add to our reception for dancing. Maybe we will move to the club instead - I'm thinking at 10, which I think is when it opens. Is it decent in there? I've only been in one AI club in Mexico and it was kinda nasty\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/unsure.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':unsure:' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1417449445,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"159.18.168.1","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"805adc73b22dc6ab3d918fabb3c37536","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(20,24,35);font-family:helvetica, arial, &#039;lucida grande&#039;, sans-serif;\"&gt;Does anyone know if there are any rooms that are suites at Now Sapphire? We have a few families wondering if there are 1 bedroom suites available so that the kids\/adults can have separate spaces. We&#039;ve asked our TA but haven&#039;t heard back yet. I don&#039;t see anything on their web site and I think our WC told us that all the rooms are the same, other than the view. Hoping that is not the case. Seems like there should be family suites, given that the resort bills itself as a family resort. Thanks for any insight!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893948,"PostDate":1429720017,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"color:rgb(20,24,35);font-family:helvetica, arial,'lucida grande', sans-serif;\">Does anyone know if there are any rooms that are suites at Now Sapphire? We have a few families wondering if there are 1 bedroom suites available so that the kids\/adults can have separate spaces. We've asked our TA but haven't heard back yet. I don't see anything on their web site and I think our WC told us that all the rooms are the same, other than the view. Hoping that is not the case. Seems like there should be family suites, given that the resort bills itself as a family resort. Thanks for any insight!<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1417449445,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"65.93.220.147","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"913a71260795fa80ce63086ef77d4ff0","RawContent":"[quote name=\"vancouverpetunia\" post=\"1893854\" timestamp=\"1429645962\"]\n@[member=\"DinaQtobe\"] - Are you saying that you were able to get into the club before it was open? I&#039;m just looking at my budget and thinking about cutting back on the extra hours we add to our reception for dancing. Maybe we will move to the club instead - I&#039;m thinking at 10, which I think is when it opens. Is it decent in there? I&#039;ve only been in one AI club in Mexico and it was kinda nasty  :unsure:[\/quote]Yes, we were in the club before it opened.  I can&#039;t remember exactly but I think we headed over around 9:30-10.  It was pretty dark but it seemed clean.  We couldn&#039;t get drinks (it&#039;s a very short walk to the lobby bar) but I brought my JBL portable speaker in and played music for a bit before everything got started.  When the bartenders started to get things ready I asked if they could turn on some music for us.  I don&#039;t know if it was bridal charm but they turned on dance music for us and the club lights and we danced before it all opened.  After the club opened we had an even better time!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1894000,"PostDate":1429744929,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>vancouverpetunia, on 21 April 2015 - 11:52 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"257303\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/257303-dinaqtobe\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">DinaQtobe<\/span><\/a> - Are you saying that you were able to get into the club before it was open? I'm just looking at my budget and thinking about cutting back on the extra hours we add to our reception for dancing. Maybe we will move to the club instead - I'm thinking at 10, which I think is when it opens. Is it decent in there? I've only been in one AI club in Mexico and it was kinda nasty\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/unsure.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':unsure:' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Yes, we were in the club before it opened.\u00a0 I can't remember exactly but I think we headed over around 9:30-10.\u00a0 It was pretty dark but it seemed clean.\u00a0 We couldn't get drinks (it's a very short walk to the lobby bar) but I brought my JBL portable speaker in and played music for a bit before everything got started.\u00a0 When the bartenders started to get things ready I asked if they could turn on some music for us.\u00a0 I don't know if it was bridal charm but they turned on dance music for us and the club lights and we danced before it all opened.\u00a0 After the club opened we had an even better time!!!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dinaskates84@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"74.12.203.194","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1341078220,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-257303.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DinaQtobe","Id":257303,"Name":"DinaQtobe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5612abbc025e08930182f5c24d594eb2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"DinaQtobe\"] - Thanks for the info. It looks like each extra hour of reception is going to cost $800 - $1000, so I&#039;m leaning towards cutting it short!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894003,"PostDate":1429750139,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"257303\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/257303-dinaqtobe\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">DinaQtobe<\/span><\/a> - Thanks for the info. It looks like each extra hour of reception is going to cost $800 - $1000, so I'm leaning towards cutting it short!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1417449445,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.222.45.206","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"02e77db98dfe7a35d1309adcad55db99","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;My wedding is going to be in the first week of May, and like many others I&#039;d like to time it so that we have a bit of sunlight left after the ceremony for pictures, and then can capture the sunset as well. Can anyone suggest a good time to have a ceremony so this works out well?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks!&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894046,"PostDate":1429796401,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>My wedding is going to be in the first week of May, and like many others I'd like to time it so that we have a bit of sunlight left after the ceremony for pictures, and then can capture the sunset as well. Can anyone suggest a good time to have a ceremony so this works out well?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#800080;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><em><span style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif;\">Jessica<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/span>","Email":"jessiker05@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.222.45.206","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410543113,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jessiker05","Id":279800,"Name":"jessiker05","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.222.45.206","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"894ed1f0e6816ab6163225ce7fbdd1f0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@DinaQtobe&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;font-size:15px;\"&gt;so the packages include a private dinner reception for up to 25 guests, but I can&#039;t really figure out if this means we have the space for the rest of the evening, or if there is a separate fee to use the space for the party after dinner is finished?&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894059,"PostDate":1429800560,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@DinaQtobe\u00a0<span  style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;font-size:15px\">so the packages include a private dinner reception for up to 25 guests, but I can't really figure out if this means we have the space for the rest of the evening, or if there is a separate fee to use the space for the party after dinner is finished?<\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#800080;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><em><span style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif;\">Jessica<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/span>","Email":"jessiker05@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.222.45.206","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410543113,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jessiker05","Id":279800,"Name":"jessiker05","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"159.18.168.1","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b35662ce8f9068e1adf3d2a8eaae92fb","RawContent":"[quote name=\"jessiker05\" post=\"1894046\" timestamp=\"1429796401\"]\nMy wedding is going to be in the first week of May, and like many others I&#039;d like to time it so that we have a bit of sunlight left after the ceremony for pictures, and then can capture the sunset as well. Can anyone suggest a good time to have a ceremony so this works out well?\n\nThanks!  :)[\/quote]\n@[member=\"jessiker05\"] I was just reading a thread on timing of the ceremony, photos, reception, etc. but now I can&#039;t find it! Maybe someone else can point you there. But there are suggested schedules on a local photographer&#039;s web site here: \n[url=\"http:\/\/www.octaviomontes.com\/tips.html\"]http:\/\/www.octaviomontes.com\/tips.html[\/url]\n\n[quote name=\"jessiker05\" post=\"1894059\" timestamp=\"1429800560\"]\n@DinaQtobe [color=rgb(68,68,68)][font=Calibri][size=4]so the packages include a private dinner reception for up to 25 guests, but I can&#039;t really figure out if this means we have the space for the rest of the evening, or if there is a separate fee to use the space for the party after dinner is finished?[\/size][\/font][\/color][\/quote]\nI think the included reception is 3 hours (our ceremony is scheduled for 4, the cocktail hour for 5, and our reception is supposed to end at 9). You can continue to use the space after this time, I believe, but you will have to pay additional to keep the open bar and any entertainment. The open bar is $15 per person per hour (even for your \"included\" 25 people). There is also an hourly charge for the sound system (if you are using just an iPod, etc.) and, of course, a DJ will continue to charge you. For our group of 40, it&#039;s going to be almost $800 just for the open bar (incl tax and service) per hour (at least I don&#039;t think that includes the sound system - I&#039;m waiting for confirmation).","Attachments":[],"Id":1894072,"PostDate":1429807556,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>jessiker05, on 23 April 2015 - 05:40 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>My wedding is going to be in the first week of May, and like many others I'd like to time it so that we have a bit of sunlight left after the ceremony for pictures, and then can capture the sunset as well. Can anyone suggest a good time to have a ceremony so this works out well?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279800\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279800-jessiker05\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jessiker05<\/span><\/a> I was just reading a thread on timing of the ceremony, photos, reception, etc. but now I can't find it! Maybe someone else can point you there. But there are suggested schedules on a local photographer's web site here:\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.octaviomontes.com\/tips.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.octaviomontes.com\/tips.html<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>jessiker05, on 23 April 2015 - 06:49 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@DinaQtobe\u00a0<span  style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;font-size:15px\">so the packages include a private dinner reception for up to 25 guests, but I can't really figure out if this means we have the space for the rest of the evening, or if there is a separate fee to use the space for the party after dinner is finished?<\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I think the included reception is 3 hours (our ceremony is scheduled for 4, the cocktail hour for 5, and our reception is supposed to end at 9). You can continue to use the space after this time, I believe, but you will have to pay additional to keep the open bar and any entertainment. The open bar is $15 per person per hour (even for your \"included\" 25 people). There is also an hourly charge for the sound system (if you are using just an iPod, etc.) and, of course, a DJ will continue to charge you. For our group of 40, it's going to be almost $800 just for the open bar (incl tax and service) per hour (at least I don't think that includes the sound system - I'm waiting for confirmation).\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1417449445,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.222.45.206","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2dfca43d3b879497684c3d2dda8c0f06","RawContent":"[quote name=\"vancouverpetunia\" post=\"1894072\" timestamp=\"1429807556\"]\n@[member=\"jessiker05\"] I was just reading a thread on timing of the ceremony, photos, reception, etc. but now I can&#039;t find it! Maybe someone else can point you there. But there are suggested schedules on a local photographer&#039;s web site here: \n[url=\"http:\/\/www.octaviomontes.com\/tips.html\"]http:\/\/www.octaviomontes.com\/tips.html[\/url]\n\n\nI think the included reception is 3 hours (our ceremony is scheduled for 4, the cocktail hour for 5, and our reception is supposed to end at 9). You can continue to use the space after this time, I believe, but you will have to pay additional to keep the open bar and any entertainment. The open bar is $15 per person per hour (even for your \"included\" 25 people). There is also an hourly charge for the sound system (if you are using just an iPod, etc.) and, of course, a DJ will continue to charge you. For our group of 40, it&#039;s going to be almost $800 just for the open bar (incl tax and service) per hour (at least I don&#039;t think that includes the sound system - I&#039;m waiting for confirmation).[\/quote]\nThe schedule on that website is a big help - thanks!\nHmm, yes it could get a bit pricey..","Attachments":[],"Id":1894074,"PostDate":1429808753,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>vancouverpetunia, on 23 April 2015 - 08:45 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279800\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279800-jessiker05\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jessiker05<\/span><\/a> I was just reading a thread on timing of the ceremony, photos, reception, etc. but now I can't find it! Maybe someone else can point you there. But there are suggested schedules on a local photographer's web site here:\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.octaviomontes.com\/tips.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.octaviomontes.com\/tips.html<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I think the included reception is 3 hours (our ceremony is scheduled for 4, the cocktail hour for 5, and our reception is supposed to end at 9). You can continue to use the space after this time, I believe, but you will have to pay additional to keep the open bar and any entertainment. The open bar is $15 per person per hour (even for your \"included\" 25 people). There is also an hourly charge for the sound system (if you are using just an iPod, etc.) and, of course, a DJ will continue to charge you. For our group of 40, it's going to be almost $800 just for the open bar (incl tax and service) per hour (at least I don't think that includes the sound system - I'm waiting for confirmation).\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The schedule on that website is a big help - thanks!<\/p>\n<p>Hmm, yes it could get a bit pricey..<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#800080;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><em><span style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif;\">Jessica<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/span>","Email":"jessiker05@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.222.45.206","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410543113,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jessiker05","Id":279800,"Name":"jessiker05","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"65.93.220.147","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by DinaQtobe, 23 April 2015 - 03:38 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1429832288,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e9f3e0bf64bb8fec232936cf1bbbe30f","RawContent":"[quote name=\"vancouverpetunia\" post=\"1894003\" timestamp=\"1429750139\"]\n@[member=\"DinaQtobe\"] - Thanks for the info. It looks like each extra hour of reception is going to cost $800 - $1000, so I&#039;m leaning towards cutting it short![\/quote]The sun should set a bit later in April too.  Your WC will give you a good time to have the ceremony if you want it to be right before the sun sets.  This will potentially push back your cocktail hour and reception also so you might end later than 9.  We were married at around 3:30 and it was perfect for November.  Our cocktail hour happened after the sun had gone behind the buildings and during dinner it was dark, which was fine by me, we had more than enough light from the lighting provided by the resort and the ambient light from the regular lights outside.  After dinner and speeches there was little time for a party, but the bartenders did an amazing job of bringing drinks to everyone - a few times they even brought different shots to everyone.  We stayed on the Tequila Terrace after the bartenders had packed up.  I had my own music system and this was fine.\n[quote name=\"jessiker05\" post=\"1894059\" timestamp=\"1429800560\"]\n@DinaQtobe [color=rgb(68,68,68)][font=Calibri][size=4]so the packages include a private dinner reception for up to 25 guests, but I can&#039;t really figure out if this means we have the space for the rest of the evening, or if there is a separate fee to use the space for the party after dinner is finished?[\/size][\/font][\/color][\/quote]The wedding package is very comprehensive.  The price includes the space for the wedding, cocktail hour and for the 3 hour reception (this includes the time it takes to eat dinner) afterwards.   As I mentioned above after dinner and speeches there wasn&#039;t a lot of time for the party after dinner was fiished but I brought down my own portable speaker system and we stayed and danced for a bit after the bartenders had packed up. No one will be scheduled to use that space after your wedding.  You can stay as long as you like, but there will not be bartenders.  You can extend your reception for an additional fee, but this adds up fast.  We didn&#039;t feel it was worth it for 19 people and instead, after our \"reception\" we headed to the club\/disco.  Again, I brought my speakers and we danced for a bit before it opened.  Once it opened it was a really good time - lots of people dancing and congratulating us!\n\nIf you read my review you might find it helpful.  Go to my profile and then \"reviews\".","Attachments":[],"Id":1894128,"PostDate":1429832177,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>vancouverpetunia, on 22 April 2015 - 04:48 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"257303\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/257303-dinaqtobe\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">DinaQtobe<\/span><\/a> - Thanks for the info. It looks like each extra hour of reception is going to cost $800 - $1000, so I'm leaning towards cutting it short!\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>The sun should set a bit later in April too.\u00a0 Your WC will give you a good time to have the ceremony if you want it to be right before the sun sets.\u00a0 This will potentially push back your cocktail hour and reception also so you might end later than 9.\u00a0 We were married at around 3:30 and it was perfect for November.\u00a0 Our cocktail hour happened after the sun had gone behind the buildings and during dinner it was dark, which was fine by me, we had more than enough light from the lighting provided by the resort and the ambient light from the regular lights outside.\u00a0 After dinner and speeches there was little time for a party, but the bartenders did an amazing job of bringing drinks to everyone - a few times they even brought different shots to everyone.\u00a0 We stayed on the Tequila Terrace after the bartenders had packed up.\u00a0 I had my own music system and this was fine.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>jessiker05, on 23 April 2015 - 06:49 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@DinaQtobe\u00a0<span  style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;font-size:15px\">so the packages include a private dinner reception for up to 25 guests, but I can't really figure out if this means we have the space for the rest of the evening, or if there is a separate fee to use the space for the party after dinner is finished?<\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>The wedding package is very comprehensive.\u00a0 The price includes the space for the wedding, cocktail hour and for the 3 hour reception (this includes the time it takes to eat dinner) afterwards.\u00a0\u00a0 As I mentioned above after dinner and speeches there wasn't a lot of time for the party after dinner was fiished but I brought down my own portable speaker system and we stayed and danced for a bit after the bartenders had packed up. No one will be scheduled to use that space after your wedding.\u00a0 You can stay as long as you like, but there will not be bartenders.\u00a0 You can extend your reception for an additional fee, but this adds up fast.\u00a0 We didn't feel it was worth it for 19 people and instead, after our \"reception\" we headed to the club\/disco.\u00a0 Again, I brought my speakers and we danced for a bit before it opened.\u00a0 Once it opened it was a really good time - lots of people dancing and congratulating us!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you read my review you might find it helpful.\u00a0 Go to my profile and then \"reviews\".<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dinaskates84@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"74.12.203.194","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1341078220,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-257303.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DinaQtobe","Id":257303,"Name":"DinaQtobe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"159.18.168.1","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"46b587e76c036cea2c89e641cddbce35","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"jessiker05\"] - I just found this web page (local photographer as well), with lots of good info for timing of photos, etc.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/seasonal-guide\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/seasonal-guide\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Can you tell I&#039;m shopping for photographers?&amp;nbsp; ;)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894269,"PostDate":1429903269,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279800\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279800-jessiker05\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jessiker05<\/span><\/a> - I just found this web page (local photographer as well), with lots of good info for timing of photos, etc.<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/seasonal-guide\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/delsolphotogr...seasonal-guide\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Can you tell I'm shopping for photographers?\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1417449445,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"62152","Title":"Now Sapphire Weddings Formerly Paradisus Riviera","LastPostDate":1430675184},"Pages":{"TotalItems":2553,"TotalPages":256,"CurrentPage":2530,"NextPage":2540,"PreviousPage":2520,"LastPage":2550},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}